WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.480
On your phone, open the App Store on an iPhone,

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.340
or Google Play on Android.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:06.770
Search for Grok.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.850
Make sure it's the official Grok app,

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.350
with the same icon you see on this screen,

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.350
then tap Get or Install.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:14.293
It's free.

